@page "/"
@using ALDevToolbox.Domain.Tools
@using ALDevToolbox.Endpoints
@using ALDevToolbox.Services
@using ALDevToolbox.Services.Tools
@inject IToolAvailability ToolAvailability
@inject DashboardService Dashboard

<PageTitle>AL Dev Toolbox</PageTitle>

@*
    Tools home, on page archetype 1 ("tool launcher"). Cards stay visible for
    unauthenticated visitors - each card just points at /login?returnUrl=<tool>
    instead of the tool itself, and we add a small lock badge so it's obvious
    sign-in is needed first. The MCP card is additionally gated on the site-wide
    MCP enable flag (no point linking to a feature the SiteAdmin turned off).

    The .section-label groups, and their names, come from the hand-off's own
    launcher. They earn their place twice over here: this page was a flat run of
    tiles with no way in other than reading all of them, and it was also missing
    four tools outright - Solutions, Pipelines, Releases and Translator were in
    the sidebar and never on the launcher, so the whole deliver half of the
    product was invisible to anyone who started from the front page.

    .tool-tile__meta carries a count only for the four tools that hold content.
    A tool that is empty is a wasted click, and the tile is the last place we
    can say so; the tools that need no data (both generators, Piper, Compare,
    MCP) get no meta line rather than a manufactured one. An empty count names
    the next step rather than stating the void.

    DIVERGENCE: the hand-off's third group is "Translate and compare" and holds
    its MCP tile. Ours holds Piper too, which is neither, and MCP is neither -
    so the group is named for what it actually contains and MCP gets its own.
    A heading that excludes half its tiles is where someone hunting for "how do
    I hook up Claude" gives up.

    DIVERGENCE: group order. The hand-off runs Build, Translate and compare,
    Deliver; ours runs Build, Deliver, Work with text, Connect an assistant.
    Deliver moves up because it is the half of the product a returning user
    comes back for, where the text tools are reached once and rarely again.
*@

<AuthorizeView>
    <Authorized>
        <div class="page">
            <div class="page__hero">
                <h1 class="page__hero-title">AL Dev Toolbox</h1>
                <p class="page__hero-sub">Pick a tool to get started.</p>
            </div>

            @* Tiles follow the same site + per-org tool toggles as the sidebar
               (see Domain/Tools/ToolCatalog.cs); a switched-off tool's tiles
               disappear here too, and a group whose tools are all off goes with
               them rather than leaving a heading over nothing. The three
               template tiles share the Templates toggle. *@
            @if (ToolVisible(ToolKey.Templates) || ToolVisible(ToolKey.Cookbook) || ToolVisible(ToolKey.ObjectExplorer))
            {
                <p class="section-label">Build</p>
                <div class="tool-grid">
                    @if (ToolVisible(ToolKey.Templates))
                    {
                        <a class="tool-tile" href="/templates/workspace">
                            <span class="tool-tile__icon"><Icon Name="folder-plus" Width="19" Height="19" /></span>
                            <div class="tool-tile__body">
                                <div class="tool-tile__title">Workspace</div>
                                <div class="tool-tile__text">Generate a multi-extension AL workspace from a runtime template.</div>
                            </div>
                        </a>
                        <a class="tool-tile" href="/templates/extension">
                            <span class="tool-tile__icon"><Icon Name="package" Width="19" Height="19" /></span>
                            <div class="tool-tile__body">
                                <div class="tool-tile__title">Extension</div>
                                <div class="tool-tile__text">Generate a single standalone AL extension.</div>
                            </div>
                        </a>
                        <a class="tool-tile" href="/templates">
                            <span class="tool-tile__icon"><Icon Name="layers" Width="19" Height="19" /></span>
                            <div class="tool-tile__body">
                                <div class="tool-tile__title">Templates</div>
                                <div class="tool-tile__text">Browse the runtime templates available for your organisation.</div>
                                <div class="tool-tile__meta">@TemplatesMeta()</div>
                            </div>
                        </a>
                    }
                    @if (ToolVisible(ToolKey.Cookbook))
                    {
                        <a class="tool-tile" href="/cookbook">
                            <span class="tool-tile__icon"><Icon Name="square-code" Width="19" Height="19" /></span>
                            <div class="tool-tile__body">
                                <div class="tool-tile__title">Cookbook</div>
                                <div class="tool-tile__text">Search the AL recipe library and suggest new ones.</div>
                                <div class="tool-tile__meta">@CookbookMeta()</div>
                            </div>
                        </a>
                    }
                    @if (ToolVisible(ToolKey.ObjectExplorer))
                    {
                        <a class="tool-tile" href="/object-explorer">
                            <span class="tool-tile__icon"><Icon Name="search" Width="19" Height="19" /></span>
                            <div class="tool-tile__body">
                                <div class="tool-tile__title">Object Explorer</div>
                                <div class="tool-tile__text">Browse BC releases, modules, objects, and source files.</div>
                                <div class="tool-tile__meta">@ObjectExplorerMeta()</div>
                            </div>
                        </a>
                    }
                </div>
            }

            @if (ToolVisible(ToolKey.Projects) || ToolVisible(ToolKey.Pipelines) || ToolVisible(ToolKey.Releases))
            {
                <p class="section-label">Deliver</p>
                <div class="tool-grid">
                    @if (ToolVisible(ToolKey.Projects))
                    {
                        <a class="tool-tile" href="/solutions">
                            <span class="tool-tile__icon"><Icon Name="folder-git-2" Width="19" Height="19" /></span>
                            <div class="tool-tile__body">
                                <div class="tool-tile__title">Solutions</div>
                                <div class="tool-tile__text">Point a customer's Git repositories at AL Dev Toolbox and build them into .app files.</div>
                                <div class="tool-tile__meta">@ProjectsMeta()</div>
                            </div>
                        </a>
                    }
                    @if (ToolVisible(ToolKey.Pipelines))
                    {
                        <a class="tool-tile" href="/pipelines">
                            <span class="tool-tile__icon"><Icon Name="rocket" Width="19" Height="19" /></span>
                            <div class="tool-tile__body">
                                <div class="tool-tile__title">Pipelines</div>
                                <div class="tool-tile__text">Compile some or all of a solution's extensions, and watch the build as it happens.</div>
                            </div>
                        </a>
                    }
                    @if (ToolVisible(ToolKey.Releases))
                    {
                        <a class="tool-tile" href="/releases">
                            <span class="tool-tile__icon"><Icon Name="send" Width="19" Height="19" /></span>
                            <div class="tool-tile__body">
                                <div class="tool-tile__title">Releases</div>
                                <div class="tool-tile__text">Publish a build to a customer's Business Central environment.</div>
                            </div>
                        </a>
                    }
                </div>
            }

            @if (ToolVisible(ToolKey.Translator) || ToolVisible(ToolKey.Compare) || ToolVisible(ToolKey.Piper))
            {
                <p class="section-label">Work with text</p>
                <div class="tool-grid">
                    @if (ToolVisible(ToolKey.Translator))
                    {
                        <a class="tool-tile" href="/translator">
                            <span class="tool-tile__icon"><Icon Name="languages" Width="19" Height="19" /></span>
                            <div class="tool-tile__body">
                                <div class="tool-tile__title">Translator</div>
                                <div class="tool-tile__text">Edit an XLIFF file's translation units, filter by state, and fill the gaps.</div>
                            </div>
                        </a>
                    }
                    @if (ToolVisible(ToolKey.Compare))
                    {
                        <a class="tool-tile" href="/diff">
                            <span class="tool-tile__icon"><Icon Name="git-compare" Width="19" Height="19" /></span>
                            <div class="tool-tile__body">
                                <div class="tool-tile__title">Diff</div>
                                <div class="tool-tile__text">Paste two texts side by side and see what changed.</div>
                            </div>
                        </a>
                    }
                    @if (ToolVisible(ToolKey.Piper))
                    {
                        <a class="tool-tile" href="/piper">
                            <span class="tool-tile__icon"><Icon Name="git-merge" Width="19" Height="19" /></span>
                            <div class="tool-tile__body">
                                <div class="tool-tile__title">Piper</div>
                                <div class="tool-tile__text">Turn a list of values into a pipe-separated filter, an SQL IN list, or another format.</div>
                            </div>
                        </a>
                    }
                </div>
            }

            @if (ToolVisible(ToolKey.Mcp))
            {
                <p class="section-label">Connect an assistant</p>
                <div class="tool-grid">
                    <a class="tool-tile" href="/tools/mcp">
                        <span class="tool-tile__icon"><Icon Name="bot" Width="19" Height="19" /></span>
                        <div class="tool-tile__body">
                            <div class="tool-tile__title">MCP</div>
                            <div class="tool-tile__text">Let Claude, Cursor, or another AI assistant read your templates, recipes and BC objects.</div>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>
            }
        </div>
    </Authorized>
